13:50.325 --> 13:53.419
Hold on.
Oh. Where are our hot dogs?

13:53.495 --> 13:55.429
He won't cough up the hot dogs.

13:55.497 --> 13:57.556
This goddamn cat is
screwin' up everything.

13:57.633 --> 13:59.567
We gotta get rid of the cat, Dennis.

13:59.635 --> 14:02.229
Tough titties, pal. I'm not gettin'
rid of the cat. Tough titties?

14:02.304 --> 14:05.637
Yeah, tough titties. Dennis, this
thing with the cat has gone too far.

14:05.707 --> 14:08.335
I'm puttin' my foot down. It's
gonna be either the cat or me.

14:08.410 --> 14:11.345
Okay, I choose the cat. All
right, then I'm takin' the badge.

14:11.413 --> 14:14.041
Whoa, whoa, whoa. What are you
doin'? Are you crazy? Get out of here.

14:14.116 --> 14:17.051
Hey, I bought that badge, I bought
this uniform and I bought that cop car.

14:17.119 --> 14:20.418
I don't give a shit. I'm gonna
tell you something, buddy.

14:20.489 --> 14:23.083
Your days as a cop
of this town are over.

14:23.158 --> 14:25.388
You and that mangy cat.

14:33.035 --> 14:36.527
This is a stinkin',
dirty hellhole of a town.

14:37.840 --> 14:40.468
And I'm gonna clean it up.

14:46.515 --> 14:49.814
Let's do this thing.

14:54.156 --> 14:56.181
See, now I feel very
powerless. I don't like it.

14:56.258 --> 14:58.226
I would like to beat somebody
up so I could feel better.

14:58.293 --> 15:00.727
You try to do something good,
and you get nothing in return.

15:00.796 --> 15:03.765
What is the point?
Respect. Reward.

15:03.832 --> 15:07.131
Compensation for a job well done.

15:07.202 --> 15:09.568
What's with the cat?
Don't start in on the cat.

15:09.638 --> 15:11.765
I swear to God, I will jam you
into the middle of next week.

15:11.840 --> 15:15.742
We will jam and jam and jam until there
is nothing left of the two of you to jam.

15:15.811 --> 15:17.802
Do you understand what we're
saying to you? Not really.

15:17.880 --> 15:20.906
Calm down, dude. All
right, here's the situation.

15:20.983 --> 15:24.441
Frank and I got our hands on a cop
car. We were cruisin' around in it.

15:24.520 --> 15:26.488
We were actin' like cops.

15:26.555 --> 15:28.921
Everything was goin' great, but
then it got to Frank's head...

15:28.991 --> 15:30.618
and he squeezed me out.

15:30.692 --> 15:33.320
You two have not begun to feel the
power and respect that you get...

15:33.395 --> 15:36.523
when you are
cruising around in a cop car.

15:36.598 --> 15:38.998
See, we've been cleaning up the
streets, and all we've gotten is mugged.

15:39.067 --> 15:41.035
You deserve better than that.
We deserve better than that.

15:41.103 --> 15:43.469
So here's what we gotta do.
We gotta get rid of Frank.

15:43.539 --> 15:45.530
We gotta get our hands
on that cop car.

15:45.607 --> 15:48.804
Yeah, okay. I'm in.
What's the plan? All right.

15:48.877 --> 15:52.438
Frank's got beef with a
certain hot dog vendor...

15:52.514 --> 15:54.448
and I was thinkin',
if something bad...

15:54.516 --> 15:56.507
were to happen
to one of his carts...

15:56.585 --> 15:59.145
Well, we could put
the frame on Frank.

15:59.221 --> 16:01.189
Really get him into some
trouble. Right, Jack?

16:01.256 --> 16:04.783
Bingo.
What'd you say, Charlie?

16:04.860 --> 16:07.624
Huh?
You just said something.

16:07.696 --> 16:10.221
No, I was, uh... I
think you said, "bingo. "

16:12.134 --> 16:14.898
Stop playing with your stupid tape
recorder. Go clean those bathrooms.

16:14.970 --> 16:17.404
That's not a...

16:17.472 --> 16:20.134
Charlie, clean the bathroom.
Mmm.

16:23.979 --> 16:26.345
What is this?

16:26.415 --> 16:28.645
That right there is a tale
of corruption and intrigue...

16:28.717 --> 16:31.982
the likes of which are
gonna rock this city.

16:32.054 --> 16:36.650
"Spin Doctors mix"? I taped
over the Spin Doctors mix.

16:36.725 --> 16:41.094
Sir, I do not have time to listen
to your mix tape. No, it's not a m...

16:41.163 --> 16:44.189
Look, uh, I'm ready
to blow my whistle here.

16:44.266 --> 16:47.497
You know what I'm saying? I got a
laundry list of corruption charges...

16:47.569 --> 16:49.969
Extortion, bribery, junkyard cats.

16:50.038 --> 16:53.599
This is nasty, heavy stuff. Now,
you gonna listen to this tape or not?

16:53.675 --> 16:56.610
No, I am not.
Oh.

16:56.678 --> 16:58.839
Oh, I get it.

16:58.914 --> 17:00.939
You're one of them, huh?

17:01.016 --> 17:05.043
A crooked cop.
Yeah, I get it!

17:05.120 --> 17:07.554
Everybody's a crooked cop, huh?

17:07.623 --> 17:11.753
Am I the only cop left in
Philadelphia who ain't crooked? Oh...

17:11.827 --> 17:15.593
Oh, I see what's happening.
You wanna come at Serpico, huh?

17:15.664 --> 17:18.428
Who wants a place of Serpico?
'Cause I'll give It to you.

17:18.500 --> 17:20.991
I'll give a piece, 'cause
you're forgetting about this.

17:21.069 --> 17:24.766
And you're forgetting about...
whatever the hell that is.

17:24.840 --> 17:26.774
But you're forgetting about it.

17:26.842 --> 17:30.744
And I'm gonna take this right to
the mayor, and you're gonna remember.

17:33.215 --> 17:35.740
We really gotta do something
about these homeless people.

17:38.053 --> 17:41.045
That kitty is really loving
this Molotov cocktail.

17:41.123 --> 17:43.091
Ho, ho, ho there,
Jack. That's not a toy.

17:43.158 --> 17:46.093
He's slurping down that gasoline no
problem. What's the deal with that?

17:46.161 --> 17:49.130
Yeah, he's got a thing for gasoline.
He was born in a pool of it.

17:49.197 --> 17:51.427
Hello.

17:51.500 --> 17:53.491
Just stopped in for a cold beer...

17:53.568 --> 17:56.298
to enjoy with my free hot dog.

17:56.371 --> 17:59.101
You parked in a red zone.

17:59.174 --> 18:01.472
I'm gonna let it fly
this time, but be careful.

18:01.543 --> 18:04.842
Oh, thanks, Frank. I appreciate
that. I'll take care of it.

18:04.913 --> 18:07.313
Yeah. In fact, Special
Agent Bauer and I...

18:07.382 --> 18:10.010
intend to take care
of a few things today.

18:10.085 --> 18:13.077
Oh, hey there,
guys. What's goin' on, huh?

18:13.155 --> 18:15.521
Up to no good? A little
crime and corruption?

18:15.590 --> 18:17.615
I hope you guys don't
mind if I borrow this.

18:17.693 --> 18:19.490
Whoa, whoa, whoa! Charlie,
what are you doing?

18:19.561 --> 18:22.860
Charlie, where you going? Oh,
you know where I'm going, Frank.

18:22.931 --> 18:25.297
Charlie, drop your
weapon. Don't do that.

18:25.367 --> 18:29.133
What are you doing? I'm putting
an end to this, is what I'm doing.

18:29.204 --> 18:30.796
Oh, no. Charlie...

18:30.872 --> 18:32.533
We were supposed to be cops.

18:32.607 --> 18:35.041
We were supposed to care about
justice, and it got to your head.

18:35.110 --> 18:36.873
I'll get a hose. That's
not gonna do any good.

18:36.945 --> 18:39.106
I doused the whole car
full of gasoline.

18:39.181 --> 18:41.342
What?

18:48.724 --> 18:50.453
Whoa!

18:57.065 --> 18:59.898
Goddamn It, Jack Bauer.

18:59.968 --> 19:02.402
You really are the man.

19:22.124 --> 19:24.456
Okay, Mr. Mayor.

19:24.526 --> 19:27.495
Feast your ears on
that Spin Doctors mix.

19:29.598 --> 19:31.532
Hooah!
